## Shared component

New client component under `client/src/components/shared/` (name in implementation: a list shell, not a second copy of `TodoListView`).

It owns:

- Grid header from resolved columns, reusing `ListViewHeaderMenu`, `ListViewPersonalizeModal`, and `TaskListSortHeaderBtn`.
- Sort mode per list, persisted in localStorage:
  - **Manual** (default): display order is `sortOrder`. Headers show no active sort. Drag handles work (except inbox, virtual rows, and active filter).
  - **Column:** client-side sort on the chosen column and direction. Drag handles hidden. Third click on the active column (or an explicit “Manual order” control in the header) clears the column sort and restores the saved manual order.
- Row grid template from the same column prefs. Fixed chrome stays outside personalize: drag handle, checkbox, remove. Same rule as T0056.

`TodoListView` keeps create, link-existing, item modal, inline state/priority/due edits, and `TodoListFilterBar`. It renders rows through the shared shell.

## Columns (ToDo list)

New list-view key `todo_lists`, mapped to catalog entity type `todo_list` (list metadata, not a new record type).

| field key | Default visible | Sortable | Notes |
|-----------|-----------------|----------|--------|
| type | yes | yes | ToDo / Task / Idea |
| title | yes | yes | |
| tags | yes | no | Chips via existing taggings lookup (not on `TodoListItem`) |
| state | yes | yes | Inline edit for todo and task rows |
| priority | yes | yes | Inline edit for todo and task rows |
| dueDate | yes | yes | Inline edit for todo and task rows |
| checked | no | yes | Checkbox chrome stays fixed; this column is optional display of the flag |

Idea rows stay compact where state/priority/due do not apply (current behavior).

Seed via a new Drizzle migration (`INSERT` into `entity_fields`). Extend `LIST_VIEW_KEYS` in `src/services/listViewPrefs.ts` and `ListViewKey` in `client/src/lib/listViewColumns.ts`. Update `docs/database/` for the new catalog rows and list-view key, then `npm run docs:sync-schema`.

This migration is a MINOR version bump on finish-up.

## Drag and filter

- Reorder API already exists (`todo_list_items` sort). Keep using it from the shared shell.
- Active ToDo filter: filter first, then either manual order or column sort among the visible rows. Drag disabled with a short hint.
- Inbox (`kind === "inbox"`) and virtual rows: drag stays disabled.

## QA notes for the implementation pass

- A normal ToDo list: drag still persists after reload; no column shows as sorted.
- Click State (or Title, Priority, Due, Type): rows reorder; drag handles disappear.
- Third click on that column, or Manual order: saved drag order returns and handles work again.
- Apply a filter: matching rows only; drag disabled until the filter is cleared.
- Personalize: hide Priority, reload, column stays hidden for the signed-in user.
- Inbox list: no drag; column sort still works.
- Project task list and Ideas list look unchanged.
